cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BayesClustNof1: Bayesian Clustering and Hierarchical Models for Series of N-of-1 Trials"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdullah-al-mamun-stat/BayesClustNof1"
abstract: "R package (C++ via Rcpp) that fits the Bayesian home-host clustering model and the hierarchical model to series of N-of-1 trials, with spike-and-slab time, block and period effects and optional AR(1) errors. Version 0.1.0 is the code used for all results in the accompanying paper."
keywords:
  - N-of-1 trials
  - Bayesian clustering
  - hierarchical model
  - product partition model
  - R
authors:
